'''Bezal''' is a [[Blaze]]-type [[Mob]] that spawns in rooms within the {{Zone|Stronghold}} on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Behavior ==
The Bezal floats in the air and fires multiple fireballs at the player every few seconds. It will not fly if a [[Moody Grappleshot]] has been used on it. Upon being killed, it deals {{Stat|dmg|1000}} to the player, and sets them on fire. The message "{{RawMctxt|&7The nearby blaze died and set you on fire for &c1000 &7damage!}}" will be displayed in chat.

